Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,cut through the wind and make A stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,don't let the darkness\Nwin, just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone,\Nwe'll go where we all want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Be fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just going to\Nshoot lasers at me all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop till I get enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That rapid-fire laser crap is a real pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky would love to\Nget his hands on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Final check.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No turning back. Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:03:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have another babe come. It's\Ngonna get ugly and curly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,brows can't handle this fight\Non his own he doesn't have an
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,An ounce of fear that settles\Nit, prepare the injection Miyagi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the patient has given us\Ninformed consent you may proceed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, too deep, too deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The bandages are terribly\Nthick, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so I just have to guess\Nwhere your bane is at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get them off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that would make more\Nsense, but we've come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of doctor are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:03:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:03:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the small fries to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You just worry about Sasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, iron bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys came back to lend\Nlittle old me a hand! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Armored Division!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're being controlled by someone\Nright now, but it's still a mutiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's punishable by death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam, I thought I was kicking ass,\Nbut you don't have one scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stubborn, ain't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Same goes for you, so I'm\Ngoing to give you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.98,0:05:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you can die right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, our subordinates on\Nthe performance floor have all defected!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm done wasting time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.86,0:05:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go butcher all those traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You are one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I raised you to protect the land\Nof Wado in my stead, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think\Na good father would do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a bad child for\Neating that Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked hard for that, and\Nit wasn't intended for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault I was starving to\Ndeath. You think I was happy? I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to go out to sea and now I can't even\Nswim again. And again I've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and failed to finish you off but\Nevery time you Struck me down I've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,come back stronger do you know what's\Nkept me on this island it wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Those handcuffs I'm staying here to\Nfight for the freedom of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I Mustn't falter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For I am Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tear straight through you. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:07:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah Is your man-beast\Nform that strong you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,want to see watch close\Ncuz this will be quick
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use a spruce sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You think your little\Ntwirling sword scares me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am moving an inch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, iron bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And we got your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go help anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you want them out of the way,\NI'll be more than happy to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any allies\Nanymore, so I can let loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.24,0:08:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's Finn?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a triceratops!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dyrus was ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, this is bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dangerous iron pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You bunch of morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry about yourselves\Nif you don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.78,0:08:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell is there a sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think he could fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta change my strategy, and quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:09:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,General Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't teach this in science books,\Nbut this is the Triceratops' power!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They really undersold you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he get a charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come at me, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did this guy forget how propellers work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have had it\Nspinning the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you turn it clockwise,\Nyou're gonna go in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,do I gotta tell him how\Nhis own body operates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Secured runway, as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A longer charge makes for\Na stronger charge, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Real talk, General Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it, Triderotron!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:10:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to stop his rockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,General...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,SUPPLY!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the captain when you meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,His lungs have been cleared, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's anything\Nelse we can do for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain would give him some medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, an injection. He's so pale you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,can't die wake up what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's breathing again, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your skin is as tough as armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and if that cut on your belly is\Nany sign, you're not invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Franken-sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Be for victory! Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe don't advertise\Nit next time, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly super when\Nit comes to sword fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm going to have to bust\Nout my super duper final finisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you should be!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep going this way, I'm gonna\Nlead him to the performance floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta make my stand here and\Ndown before it gets any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's try the cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:13:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Portable version!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat the Toby Robo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We strike fear into the hearts\Nof all who face us, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you down with me, Magnus Saru!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.02,0:14:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost and loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chronicle B!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The dog-dog fruit, mythical type.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your model is Okichi no Makumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a treasure you have stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've become Wano's guardian deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Absurd to think that my\Ntreasure was eaten by
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,someone who calls himself\NOdin but it doesn't Have to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,be a mistake protect Rain\Nfor me be its guardian
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,deity just like I asked you\Nto No that's a sick joke
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi has a talent for exploitation.\NI'll give him that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.48,0:15:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He made this whole\Ncountry a weapons factory
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:16:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You have plenty of slaves\Nhere The bent here will easily
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Kozuki Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I shall open the borders of Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow to set everyone free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just the samurai But all the people of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano Will join the world\Nafter all these years?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can't wait for fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:17:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end your dreams right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I fear this is no ordinary fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure have grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you've become a fine\Narchaeologist, Robin. I'm proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.24,0:17:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give your mother a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Illusion Mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.22,0:18:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Full of sweet memories to tear\Nyou apart from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.86,0:18:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Robin? Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it is enticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This illusion is a mirror, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirror that reflects my childish heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, my friends are fighting\Nfor their lives right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hardly time to reminisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Saw would never say such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,History is a treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mankind's guiding light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Illuminating us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not some illusion that\Nyou wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tres Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The illusion didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How did she see through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.54,0:20:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You really had me worried\Nback there, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could have given me a heads up that\Nyou were onto there, but, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your concern, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But I could never lose to someone who\Nwould dare use my memories against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The illusionist should work on everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they just waltz right through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Nico, I'm surprised at you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you'd be your own mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.74,0:20:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What a horrible woman you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is way too scary for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm a corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to see\Nthrough the illusions too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, they were quite cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm used to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trapped in that mist for 50 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,wishing I would wake up from my\Nnightmare and find my friends alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.10,0:21:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see visions like that every\Nday, you learn to live with pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I think you and\NI have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.48,0:21:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we both found our way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Yudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:21:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeve-swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.64,0:22:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She's using that wheel's weapon again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually shocked you two\Ndidn't fall from my illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you're clearly\Nliving in a dream world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you could ever be Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.86,0:22:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Spider, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire floor is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.42,0:22:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Naccomplishing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to burn\Ndown the whole castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worried about our castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't you\Nbe a good girl and surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you keep holding on to me\Nfor a moment, if you'd be so kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that weapon is a living thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can work with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind, but\NI don't do well in the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.22,0:23:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This calls for a soul break.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.04,0:23:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.84,0:24:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't know when to quit, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.80,0:24:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.88,0:24:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.64,0:24:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend sold you out so that he could\Nescape, and then he left you here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.68,0:24:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg knew you were my target, but he\Nstill called for you when I asked him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.76,0:24:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.42,0:24:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest pirates in the\Nworld all have their eyes on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's turned you into a\Nliability to your crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.68,0:24:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg couldn't wait to get rid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.52,0:24:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.14,0:24:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.16,0:24:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's the laughing\Nstock of the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.94,0:24:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.42,0:24:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,His bounty's rather high.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.96,0:24:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Second highest in your crew, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.22,0:24:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't reflect too\Nwell on the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.38,0:24:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.56,0:24:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:24:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.56,0:25:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, shall I leave this\Nparticular foe to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.54,0:25:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.28,0:25:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Good because these\Nladies need my attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.52,0:25:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.64,0:25:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bone to pick with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.10,0:25:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I hurt your feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.90,0:25:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.20,0:25:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji is kinder than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to understand\Nwhy he asked for my help
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.94,0:25:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and you don't need to know\Nhow much that means to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.68,0:25:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should know when the\Nnew king of the pirates soars,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll be one of his wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end this, Pigante! Blur!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.02,0:26:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.58,0:26:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That certainly is an impressive\Ntrick you've pulled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.74,0:26:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.56,0:26:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.84,0:26:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll all be over before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.12,0:26:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, sea serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap! Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.70,0:26:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.86,0:26:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.36,0:26:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.27,0:26:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd just stand\Nhere and let you beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.10,0:26:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So hitting these arms\Nhurts your real body, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.16,0:27:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've turned yourself into\Nsuch a nice big target.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.44,0:27:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So much to jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.00,0:27:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I hardly know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.42,0:27:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Light, wouldn't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.50,0:27:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are poison bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.78,0:27:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maria Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.38,0:27:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,More meat, more meat, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.54,0:27:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Better give him what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.00,0:27:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already eaten all the\Nprovisions on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.60,0:27:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and have you noticed where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.30,0:27:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think\Nthey have a butcher shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.58,0:27:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.24,0:27:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, how did your crew find Luffy Taro?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.74,0:27:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell into the sea. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.78,0:28:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw him sinking and\Npicked him up in our sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.48,0:28:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ufiyu, you really did survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So glad you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.48,0:28:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.02,0:28:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You fall down too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.42,0:28:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, or rather we escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.04,0:28:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu flew us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.02,0:28:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I perilled titans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku and Kin'emon, they helped us play.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.08,0:28:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They protected us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Master King
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.78,0:28:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You always do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.64,0:28:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.86,0:28:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the leader of the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.92,0:28:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.02,0:28:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a battle to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.92,0:28:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta beat Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.86,0:28:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No crying until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.64,0:28:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.76,0:28:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking to him like that\Nis only making it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us a backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.54,0:28:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.45,0:28:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be Shogun someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.86,0:29:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move! I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.74,0:29:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.92,0:29:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all stop yelling\Nand look for some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.30,0:29:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.20,0:29:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.40,0:29:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.42,0:29:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's at death's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.70,0:29:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.16,0:29:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Really bad. What's\Ngoing to happen to me if
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.94,0:29:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,he dies i didn't account\Nfor this in my plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.86,0:29:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be stuck in\Nthis hell whole country
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.00,0:29:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,without a friend in sight\Ni need him to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This hey
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.74,0:29:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.96,0:29:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,need you to take me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.96,0:29:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,back to Onigashima turn\Ninto a dragon fly me up
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.94,0:29:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.48,0:29:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do the rest.
